            "\n",
            "Next, we vary the block size and number of global tokens for the Global-Local encoder, with results shown in Table~\\ref{tab:table_3_global_block_and_tokens}.\\footnote{A number of experiments with very small block sizes or number global tokens ran into memory issues, owing to the way in which TPUs pad small dimensions of arrays to certain minimum lengths, leading to larger than expected memory consumption.}\n",
